					<td id="NewsCell" width="100%"><font size = 4><b>Happy Thanksgivin!</font></b> <br><font size = 2><i>Solanthious          - 11/28/2002 7:08:11 PM</i></font><br><br><P align=center><STRONG><FONT size=7>HAPPY THANKSGIVING!</FONT></STRONG></P>
<P align=center><IMG src=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/turkey.jpg></P>
<P>The goats of Lanys would like to wish you all a happy and warm turkey day!!! Come on everyone eat up drink down and get FAT! More killing to come next week!</P>
<P>OK it would NOT be a update without some quotes.</P>
<P><IMG src=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/yanni.JPG></P>
<P>Waaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaayyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyy too much info Jeebs.</P>
<P>THIS is whats REALLY wrong with the youth of America.</P>
<P><IMG src=/oryx/images/comp.JPG></P>
<P>Kids....I tell ya.</P><br><hr align = left width = 10%><font size = 4><b>Laying down on the job</font></b> <br><font size = 2><i>Solanthious          - 11/27/2002 11:59:46 AM</i></font><br><br><P><STRONG>Dain Frostweaver the IV......</STRONG> you all know him, some of you hate him, some of you love him, and 90% of you that have killed him have seen you or someone you know get your ass waxed by his famous drive by. Not tonight, oh no. Thanks to some awesome pulling from our monk crew...........</P>
<P><IMG height=209 src=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/dain.JPG width=534 209px HEIGHT: 565px;></P>
<P>Dain dropped faster then&nbsp;my ex&nbsp;to her knees on prom night. Grats <STRONG>Daktarr </STRONG>on his head for <STRONG>Belt of Dwarf Slaying, Strikey</STRONG> on <STRONG>Frostweavers Embroidered Cloak, Mistii </STRONG>on <STRONG>Tri - Plated Golden Hackle Hammer, </STRONG>and one of our warrior twinks on his 2hs.</P>
<P>Nice clean kill guys.</P>
<P>Now I'm told the gnome in <STRONG>Plane of Innovation</STRONG> is up, so we rush on over, hoping the little shit doesnt warp on us right near the end of the pathing. We were lucky and he didnt so with <STRONG>Xanamech </STRONG>at 50% I get randomly kicked to desktop yay me! I log back in to this.</P>
<P><IMG height=466 src=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/dragpoi.JPG width=461 HEIGHT: 314px 560px;></P>
<P>So he coughed us up another <STRONG>Cord Hilted Spike Driver, </STRONG>grats to <STRONG>Menellaos </STRONG>on that, and a <STRONG>Pulsating Phase Emitter</STRONG> for <STRONG>Krypta.</STRONG></P>
<P>Oh yeah, and thanks to a certain <STRONG>Magician </STRONG>of mine, 3 dragon kills in PoI and I still don't have a factory flag......</P>
<P>Was a good night for us&nbsp;, as both <STRONG>Alexara </STRONG>and <STRONG>Bananea </STRONG>finished their <STRONG>8th Coldain Prayer Shawl! </STRONG>Grats to both of you.</P>
<P><STRONG>WTF????</STRONG></P>
<P><IMG height=62 src=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/intoks.JPG width=506 HEIGHT: 70px 541px;></P>
<P>Snowballing anyone?</P>
<P><IMG src=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/hara.JPG></P>
<P>Don't we all <STRONG>Harabakc</STRONG>, dont we all.</P>
<P><STRONG>Dain</STRONG> does something to me that turns me into a bitch.</P>
<P><IMG height=498 src=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/solabitch.JPG width=277 HEIGHT: 405px 192px;></P><br><hr align = left width = 10%><font size = 4><b>Ch-ch-changes...</font></b> <br><font size = 2><i>Dhido                - 11/26/2002 1:26:16 PM</i></font><br><br><P>This update isn't really to detail our accomplishments, but to inform of some changes in the world of the goats...</P>
<P>First, we'd like to formally thank Rydius for all the time, effort, and dedication he gave Oryx while he was here. His dreams and ideas have become a reality for us all, and without him we'd not be here. Thank you, Rydius. We all miss you, and love you.</P>
<P>Second, we have a brand spankin' new guild leader : <STRONG>Solanthious</STRONG>!</P>
<P>In Rydius's stead, Sola has led us triumphantly, showing his wonderful leadership qualities. Thank you, Sola, and Oryx has a bright future with you at the front.</P>
<P>Stay tuned for more updates, friends! </P><br><hr align = left width = 10%></td>

